      "category": "Text",
      "text": "F. Under the direction of the Mayor, the Operations Board is responsible for applying for and securing grants, allocations, loans or assignments of services or other aids under the terms of the Federal Government's Economic Opportunity Act of 1964, or any other federal or state act providing such aids for these or related programs.",
